halt|halt [-f] [-n]
poweroff|poweroff [-f] [-n]
chown|chown OWNER[:GROUP] FILE...
rngseed|rngseed load|save FILE
rtspcat|rtspcat URL [-o FD] [-n COUNT] [-k SECS] [-t SECS] [-v]
httpd|HTTP server primitive: listen, accept one request, reply
